[E0308] Error: `..` takes the rest of the fields from a value that is there
    ╭─[ err/154_struct_update/main.wip:26:36 ]
    │
 26 │     val built = Window(width: 3, ..make())
    │                                    ───┬──  
    │                                       ╰──── not a variable, a field or an element
    │ 
    │ Help: put it in a variable first, and name that after `..`
    │ 
    │ Note: each field is copied from where it lies, so the value is read and not built
────╯
