[E0308] Error: `name` is `String`, which owns memory
    ╭─[ err/154_struct_update/main.wip:30:33 ]
    │
 30 │     val two = Owning(size: 2, ..one)
    │                                 ─┬─  
    │                                  ╰─── not a field `..` can copy
    │ 
    │ Help: give `name` a value of its own in the literal, or build the whole value with `move`
    │ 
    │ Note: `..` copies the fields it takes, and a value that owns memory has one owner
────╯
